invalid type: string "# Recovery and Injury Prevention\n\n## Sleep â€” The Most Important Recovery Tool\n\nSleep is when your body actually adapts to training. During deep sleep, growth hormone peaks, muscle protein synthesis accelerates, and the brain consolidates motor learning.\n\n**How much you need:**\n- **Adults:** 7-9 hours per night\n- **Athletes / heavy training:** 8-10 hours\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ